# Mogged

Native macOS **desktop app**. Open Mogged → Play → Windows PC game runs well on Apple Silicon.

Not a compatibility manager. Not a toolkit frontend. The product is the app.

## Proof order

Follow `docs/MILESTONES.md`. No weeks, no calendar.

1. M0 machine + smoke title eval
2. M1 Play launches the free Steam smoke title
3. M2–M3 Marvel's Spider-Man Remastered boots, then hits the quality bar
4. M4 second different-engine title

Elden Ring is not MVP.

## Build

Write the Swift desktop app, profiles, caches, input, telemetry. Do not write a Windows/DirectX translator. Do not build a bottle GUI.

Measure FPS; do not claim "feels native" without a benchmark file.
